# Memory Index

> This file is the auto-loaded index. Keep it under 200 lines (most agent harnesses truncate after that). Move detail into the linked topic files.

## File conventions

All memory files live in this directory and use prefix-typed filenames:

| Prefix | Contents | Lifetime |
|---|---|---|
| `project_*` | Active work, ongoing initiatives, session logs | Days to months |
| `feedback_*` | Operator decisions, locked doctrines, lessons learned | Long-lived |
| `reference_*` | Canonical patterns, playbooks, how-to docs | Long-lived |
| `user_*` | Operator identity, preferences, focus areas | Long-lived |

Each file has frontmatter:

```markdown
---
name: <short title>
description: <one-line, used to decide relevance in future sessions>
type: <project | feedback | reference | user>
---
```

